        "description": "No evidence of metabolic bone disease or systemic involvement",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of all three major criteria: wormian bones, diaphyseal widening of long bones, and cranial bone thickening",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is primarily radiological supported by clinical features; genetic testing may assist but is not definitive."
  },
